<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Prestasi full yr shr rises, div up.</title>
<headline>Prestasi full yr shr rises, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     11.90	 vs	11.07</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  3.50	 vs	 3.25</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   10.26	 vs	 9.42</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   16.91	 vs	15.81</p>
<p>    Tax			  6.25	 vs	 6.27</p>
<p>    Turnover		  94.06	 vs	82.13</p>
<p>Div payable April 4</p>
<p>on register March 20</p>
<p>Full name: Prestasi Financial Services Ltd (banks and financial services)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said prospects for the 1997 year were favourable and it expected unit Compass to contribute substantially to the group results as it would be the first year of inclusion. It said the client growth in Prestasi Brokers was expected to continue, which should positively affect group results for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
